window.products.push({"id":631052,"name":"Soap of Steel Stainless-Steel Scent Remover and 100% Waterproof Pine Tray, Metal Soap Bar for Rub Away Odor Removal from Hands (Natural)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fat1iR85L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The best recipes start with the aromatics: onions, garlic, and peppers. But you don't want to smell them on your hands long after you've enjoyed your delicious meal. Bottles of hand soap with fragrance are nice, but if you're still cooking and need to move on and prepare dessert, or if you just don't like your hands smelling like spring meadow flowers or summer rain, this stainless-steel bar soap is for you. It has other uses around the house as well. After using household cleaning supplies, try this to get the industrial smell off of your hands. If you're a fisherman or an outdoorsman, keep this stainless-steel odor remover bar with you and use it to remove fish and other gamey smells off of your hands. It's also useful at the office in the breakroom. To use it, simply rub the stainless-steel metal soap bar on your hands under running water. This cooking gadget won't rust and will last through unlimited uses without needing to be replaced.This gleaming stainless-steel soap bar looks like it should be in a high-concept kitchen magazine, and it will look good in your kitchen, too. It comes with a completely waterproof wooden rack made of pine, which adds to the contemporary elegance. This steel soap bar also makes a brilliant housewarming gift or holiday gift. It makes such a striking presentation that people will wonder what it is and be surprised and impressed by its abilities. It makes a great stocking stuffer for that friend who likes to cook or the family member who is hard to shop for.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fat1iR85L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stainless Soap","source_asin":"B08FBPP11P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FBPP11P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FBPP11P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
