window.products.push({"id":631157,"name":"Bizarre Strange Weird Decor Vintage Boy with Quirky Giant Chicken Poster - 11x14 Unframed Vintage Print - Perfect Oddities, Curiosities Goth Decor Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ldEUuCOEL._AC_SL1244_.jpg","description":"UNFRAMED PRINT - I have to put this in for the people that don't read the words Unframed Print in the title. Of course if they didn't read the title or the words on the pictures they probably won't read this LOL. We tried. It's a print. It's not printed on wood, stone, slate, matboard, or any other kind of substrate. It's not thick sign, it's a print. It's not framed. That's why every picture says \"Frame not Include\". If you did read this far, Thank You MAKES A GREAT GIFT - My huge portfolio makes it easy to find the perfect gift for the people you care about. Friends love to get them for Birthdays, Christmas, Hanukkah, weddings, anniversaries, retirement, graduation, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day or house warming. Makes a great gift for your friends, husband, wife, son daughter mom, dad, co-workers, grandfather, grandmother, aunt uncle, cousin, spouse, or boss PERFECT FOR ANY ROOM - They look great in living rooms, dens, bedrooms, kitchens, entries, dining rooms, bathrooms, offices, man-caves, she sheds, home bars, game rooms, dorms or garages READY TO FRAME - You get one 11\"x 14\" print. 11\" x 14\" frames are super easy to buy here on Amazon or at any department or craft store. Choose the frames that work with your decor and the print! MADE TO LAST - This print is printed on semi-matte Fuji Crystal Archive paper to last a lifetime. PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA - All of my designs are printed here in the good-old USA and packages at our studio in Tomball, TX by a hard-working group of employees that still care about producing quality products LOVE IT OR SEND IT BACK - It's pretty simple, love it or we'll gladly take it back. That's it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ldEUuCOEL._AC_SL1244_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lone Star Art","source_asin":"B07B4PP1BB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4PP1BB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4PP1BB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":631158,"name":"BREEZEWELL 2-in-1 Evaporative Air Cooler, 43\" Tower Fan w/Cooling & Humidification Function, 1 Gallon Water Tank, 3 Wind Speeds, 4 Modes, 70°Oscillati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rjRTQ16jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❆【4 Functional Breeze Mode Options】Designed, programmed and engineered for adaptability. 4 Modes (normal/natural/sleep/cooling) meet your basic daily needs. In natural mode, the evaporative cooler will blow out faster and slower winds intermittently and may stop briefly to simulate a natural breeze. Breezewell has developed this easy-to-use portable air conditioner for you. 3-level adjustable wind speed is only a push of power bottom between you and the widespread coolness. ❆【Efficient Cooling Power & Humidification】Do you know that an evaporative air cooler can lower room temperature by around 11°F in the hot summer? This tower fan with humidification and cooling function will be your secret weapon to survive during the heating months! The evaporative cooling process naturally humidifies dry wind and brings you cooling wind. It is tested that this room cooler with up to 1 Gallon of the water reservoir and 2 Ice Packs can easily bring up the humidity by 82%. ❆【70° Wide Oscillating】Featured with a 70° automatic wide swing and an a18inch-long extended wind outlet to give all the comfortable natural cooling wind in your space. Instead of pushing cool in one direction, using the horizontal swing function will make the portable evaporative cooler faster and more efficiently circulate the cooling wind around the room. ❆【20FT Remote Convenient Control】Easy to control your portable room air conditioner from 20ft with the Remote, not just the LED touch panel, making it possible that enjoy a gentle outdoor wind in your own living room while you are reading your favorite books or enjoying the recent series without getting up from the couch. ❆【15Hours Timmer, Low Noise】Breezewell bedroom air conditioner provides you with the maximum 15-hour timing control. Sleep with peace of mind and do not worry that you will be awakened by the heat. The turn off timer also lowers your cost by limiting the running time. Plus Low Noise, less than 50db which can take you good care in the sleeping night. ❆【Sleek Design & Real Space-Saving】The floor space is equivalent to the size of A4 paper, the stand up ac unit itself is ultra-thin design, beautiful and does not occupy space. The built-in handle and slim body are designed for easy movement. It is suitable for small and medium-sized rooms, such as bedrooms, offices, living rooms, kitchens, etc. The portable swamp cooler is also very suitable for personal use. ❆【A Good Alternative for AC】If you don't want to install a window AC in hot summer, then you can't miss BREEZEWELL windowless air conditioner, which is a great alternative for the real ac. It doesn't require the window or a hose to be connected to the outside of the house for water to flow out. No need for complicated installation, cooling you down and it also helps with dryness in your room. ❆【Energy-Saving & Eco-friendly】Compared with your costly AC, Breezewell Portable Evaporative Air Cooler has no compressor and does not use chemical refrigerants and it is more environmentally friendly and safe for daily use. By adding ice or cold water, you can easily enjoy extra coolness in seconds at a low cost. Moreover, the 43inch oscillating tower fan cooler only uses up to 60 Watt per day. This means you can confidently run it for long hours without fear of spending more on energy costs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rjRTQ16jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BREEZEWELL","source_asin":"B08QHPC51Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QHPC51Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QHPC51Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
