window.products.push({"id":631280,"name":"Metal Chopsticks Reusable 18/8 Stainless Steel Chopsticks Multipack Dishwasher Safe Chop Sticks Fancy Laser Engraved Non-slip Japanese Korean Chopstic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rta71QxNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Greatamzor reusable metal chopsticks are square chopsticks made of food grade 304 stainless steel with laser engraving pattern on chopsticks body and nonslip laser etching on chopsticks tip The remarkable advantages of our chopsticks: ✿HealthyThe metal chopsticks are made of food grade 304 stainless steel. The pattern and anti-slip etching on the stainless steel chopsticks are laser etching. Unlike the color wooden chopsticks or applique metal chopsticks, laser etching metal chopsticks don't have the pollution that caused by the coating or painting peeling off easily. The laser etching is permanent and no fading.✿Sanitary& Dishwasher SafeThe metal chopsticks are with smooth hard surface. Easy to clean by dishwasher or by hand. The bamboo chopsticks and wooden chopsticks, due to the loose construction, gain the food residue and liquid easily during using. It's very hard to clean up as the dirt hide deeply inside the chopsticks. That's why they get moldy easily. Stainless steel chopsticks always stay sanitary.✿Anti-slip DesignWith reinforced laser etching on the chopsticks tip, our metal chopsticks are easier to grab food & keep food from slipping. The square chopsticks won't roll and hold comfortable on hand.✿Durable & Eco-friendlyThe stainless steel chopsticks are sturdy and durable. The stainless chopsticks won't get moldy or glitched as the wooden chopsticks /bamboo chopsticks do. The 304 chopsticks stand the temperature torment during cooking/frying without any melting issue as the fiberglass chopsticks. One set chopsticks can use forever. It saves the trouble&money to replace the chopsticks frequently. Thinking of the tons of disposable chopsticks that turn into rubbish everyday, the metal chopsticks are Eco-friendly. ❥Specification Length: 9 1/4 In (23.5cm) longWeight: 1.16 oz (33g) per pairMaterial: 304(18/8) stainless steel ❥Package 5 Pairs set","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rta71QxNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greatamzor","source_asin":"B08VWK7HJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VWK7HJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VWK7HJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
