window.products.push({"id":631415,"name":"Aomesinc Vinyl Record Area Rug, Fashion Vinyl Record Pattern Floor Mat, Round Non Slip Rug((80X80cm),Style F)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wnM1hG9RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"►Warm Tips: Our area rug is folded when packaging, so it may has creases inevitably when you receive it. Here is our advice for you to deal with this problem: Fill a watering can with warm water and spray the warm water on the carpet, wait for about 10 minutes. Dry the carpet with a hair dryer, and then the creases of the carpet will disappear. If this method still can't solve the problem, you can try to use steam iron to gently steam out the creases of the carpet. ►Vinyl Record Rug: This area rug dares to break the conventional design by creating a 3D stereoscopic visual effect through the use of classical vinyl record pattern. The clever use of stripes and shadows makes this room carpet with classical vinyl record pattern look more vivid. It can be a good choice for music lovers. This rug mat can be easily integrated with your existing decoration and inject a stylish atmosphere into your house/music room. ►High-quality Workmanship: This record carpet is made of crystal velvet fabric that containing 100% microfiber polyester and has the advantages of good water absorption, no shrink, no pilling-up and no deforming. The edge of this floor mat adopts a tight edging design, which can effectively ensure that the edge is not easy to open. Besides, this non slip rug also adopts a point-plastic particle anti-skid base cloth in its bottom to effectively ensure your safety. ►Various Application: The interior of this modern area rug is made of high-quality felt, which is soft and comfortable. So you can rest assured to step on it. Suitable for various indoor locations like music room, living room, bedroom, balcony, reading area, entrance, playroom, office, bathroom, study, etc. ►Convenient Cleaning of This Record Rug: The dust and dirt on the surface of this soft carpet can be easily removed. You can use a vacuum cleaner to blow away its dust, or you can also put it in the washing machine, add some mild detergent to wash and then let it dry naturally.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wnM1hG9RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aomesinc","source_asin":"B09GFJGKHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GFJGKHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GFJGKHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
