window.products.push({"id":631445,"name":"Fresh Amaze Food Vacuum Sealer Machine Includes a Digital Kitchen Scale & 10X Vaccum Sealer Bags | Easy To Use Sous Vide Food Sealer With Strong Sucti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L-9uGedvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPACT YET POWERFUL - FreshAmaze food vacuum sealer machine with great suction power removes all the air sufficiently and seals quick and tight without having to go over the bag multiple times. It's foolproof, the food sealer power feature works as good as commercial grade ones. However, It's small and compact enough to leave in a drawer and lightweight to handle and fairly quiet which is recommended for home use UNBEATABLE VALUE - It comes with everything needed to get started without having to purchase additional items. Our SUPPER EASY TO USE food vaccum sealer just work! It only have 2 buttons which are easy to use. It's ready to go right out of the box! You can line up the bag correctly with 2 little bag clips, easy to close without the need for high pressure, and easy to open by using the vacuum releasing valve. IT'S A HEDGE AGAINTS FOOD INFLATION PRICES- Using a food saver vacuum sealer machine is one simple step to keep your products fresh for longer and store for future use without a stale taste, dry spots, or freezer burn. Whether you have a small or big family, you can buy in bulk for a better overall household economy. The seal a meal vacuum sealer machine can also be used for all food saving storage needs. Save food now instead of throwing it away. A great way to seal a meal. FAST & EASY SOUS VIDE - The sous vide vacuum sealer machine completely removes air and allows meat and vegetables to SUBMERGE SUFFICIENTLY without the need for a rack or weights. It's perfect for sous vide as it offers a tight and waterproof seal A RELIABLE FOOD SEALER MACHINE - The vacuum sealer for food comes with 10 commercial-grade vacuum food sealer bags, kitchen scale, and user manual. It has ETL, RoHS, and CE certificates and is backed by a 6-month warranty. Contact our friendly customer service team for support. If you’re looking for a UNIQUE & FUNCTIONAL GIFT for your friends and family members, the Fresh Amaze vacuum sealer machine is a gift they will love & enjoy using, thanks to the POWERFUL SUCTION and SUPPER EASY TO USE function.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L-9uGedvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fresh Amaze","source_asin":"B09BZZLDGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BZZLDGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BZZLDGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
