window.products.push({"id":631539,"name":"Prinoff Swedish Dishcloths, Eco-Friendly Absorbent Cellulose Sponge Cloths Sets No Odor Biodegradable and Reusable Microfiber Cleaning Dish Cloths Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712GHMO78XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Easy to Cleaning Dish Cloths with Super Oil Repellency: Prinoff dish cloths are Dishwasher, Washing machine and Microwave safe. It can be washed in your clothes or dish washer up to 200 times. Combined with detergent, cellulose sponges can produce rich foam, and the decontamination effect is more obvious. Super Absorbent and Fast Drying Sponge Cloths: Our Swedish dishcloths combine the benefits of a traditional kitchen dish towel with the super absorbency of a cellulose sponge. Small holes inside the Sponge Cloths make them can absorb and hold liquid up to 20x of their own weight. For the microporous structure, Prionff Sponge Cloths can dry fast easily without odor. Eco-Friendly Swedish Dishcloths: Prinoff odor-free dish towels are made from biodegradable cellulose and natural cotton materials (70% cellulose + 30% cotton), they can be used as compost after you've used them all up. Prinoff dish towels can provide you with a simple way to reduce your waste output and clean more efficiently. Kitchen Towels with Great Design: Prinoff kitchen dish towels combines the features of sponge and microfiber cloth. Wipes like a cloth, absorbs like a sponge. soften when wet, allowing for streakless cleaning, non scratch on subject and non-irritating to your skin; hard when dry, keeping its characteristics to prevent the accumulation of odors, removing the need for stinky kitchen rags and infested sponges. Money Saving Rags for Cleaning: Prinoff kitchen rags are reusable. One pack of rag can be used for up to one month, with proper care these bulk 10 pack kitchen rags can last up to one year. It’s 200 times machine washable, save your time and money from repeatedly buying paper towel rolls.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712GHMO78XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prinoff","source_asin":"B088DB8NTT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088DB8NTT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088DB8NTT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
