window.products.push({"id":631543,"name":"JUVEA Essential w/Cotton Cover - 100% Natural Talalay Latex Low-Profile Bed Pillow for Sleeping. Breathable, Pressure Relief, Durable. Oeko-TEX & FSC ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vlgJc1Q9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"JUVEA ESSENTIAL Low-Profile collection designed for back sleepers, small and medium frames, or if you like low-profile pillows. 100% Natural Talalay latex is known for its shape and buoyant feeling supporting your neck and head at all times. BREATHABLE & COOLING: The JUVEA pillows are made with open-cell technology, which allows for better air circulation and temperature management.SAFE & FREE FROM HARMFUL CHEMICALS - 100% natural latex is OEKO-TEX Class 1 Baby Safe . Standard 100 certification: 11-24246. The pillow does have a slight scent to it which comes from the natural latex product. We recommend removing the product from its packaging upon arrival for at least 4 hours prior to use. MADE IN USA: JUVEA is proud to manufacture quality, healthy sleep products that you and your family can feel good about. Sleep peacefully knowing your pillow will not flatten over time. COVER SELECTION: JUVEA ESSENTIAL is perfectly paired with your choice of one of three removable covers options - Cotton, Organic Cotton or Tencel. EFFORTLESS AIRFLOW: 100% Natural latex pillows are made with open-cell technology, which allows for better air circulation and temperature management. ORGANIC & ECO-FRIENDLY: Made from high-quality organic natural plant latex. Pillows are vegan, and cruelty-free. We are dedicated to providing comfort and wellness to your sleep experience. Better than any other foam pillow, Talalay latex, temperature-regulating components and materials draw heat away from the body to create a cool and comfortable sleep surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vlgJc1Q9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUVEA","source_asin":"B0C6FKSNYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6FKSNYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6FKSNYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":631544,"name":"ER CHEN 12 Set of Micro 20 LEDs Super Bright Rope Lights Battery Operated 7 Ft Long Ultra Thin Copper Wire Starry String Lights for Home Bedroom Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61keehuee-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ER CHEN(TM) Bright LED Dewdrop Starry String Lights create a magical lighting experience for your home, party or business The LED Starry copper wire String Lights are made with a fine bendable copper wire that can conform to any shape to add a beautiful decorative accent. Flexible yet durable, the string lights are perfect for positioning lights to any decorative or holiday project. It is easy to use, just click the button on the battery box, it can light up for at least 48 hours, and looks just like stars bright at night which create a romantic sentiment. The Decor light is perfect for spice up your decoration and adds welcome feelings to your party, restaurant and shops. Due to its moldable shapes, the copper wires are flexible and easily mold into any shape you like. It can be wound around furniture, beds, windows, staircases, bars, frames, rafters, fireplace mantels, patios, balconies, boat decks, and more. Note: This water drop Flexible Starry String Lights are designed to be used both indoors and outdoors, however, we recommend not to submerge in the water, only use it outdoor when it is not rain. 1 year warranty from ER CHEN.Feel free to contact us for replacment if your received broken or damaged item. Package included: 12 x led starry string lights(batteries included). Tips：Before you use the item，don't forget to remove the transparent insulation on the batteries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61keehuee-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ER CHEN","source_asin":"B01DPB8WBE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DPB8WBE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DPB8WBE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":631545,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast-Iron 4-1/2-Quart Round French Oven, Kiwi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oK-aq-dAL._AC_SL1324_.jpg","description":"Product Description Beautiful enough for the table yet durable enough to outlive its lifetime limited warranty, this heavy, round, 4-1/2-quart French oven blends a large capacity with a stovetop-friendly size that makes it easier to work among crowded burners while preparing classics like coq au vin or beef bourguignon, and everyday favorites like pot roast. Like all Le Creuset cast-iron products, it's hand cast in a one-of-a-kind sand mold and hand finished at the Le Creuset factory in France. The cast-iron oven provides a colorful, long-lasting exterior enamel that resists chipping and cracking and a durable, nonreactive sand-colored interior enamel that offers a smooth surface for cooking, as well as an optimal palette for food presentation. As cast iron is unexcelled for even heat distribution and superior heat retention, and enamel is impervious to acids and odors, the oven browns and cooks food uniformly and gently without hot spots and can be used for marinating, cooking on the stovetop, or finishing in the oven. Two loop cast-iron side handles help ensure safe transport and a steady grip even when wearing oven mitts, and the unit's secure-fitting lid locks in heat and moisture while cooking. The lid's phenolic knob withstands heat up to 350 degrees F, and the vessel can be safely used on any stovetop, including induction. Though dishwasher-safe, the French oven should be hand washed for best results. Amazon.com The beautiful, round French oven is perhaps the most well-known of all Le Creuset cookware. Each is individually sand-cast of rugged cast iron, then clad in two coats of hard, colorful enamel. The result? Cookware so durable it's covered by a lifetime warranty, and so attractive you'll proudly bring it to the table. Cast iron retains and distributes heat evenly, making the pot with its tight-fitting lid especially good for the slow, stovetop simmering of soups and stews. Because the black phenolic lid knob is oven-safe to 400 degrees, the pot and lid can be used to roast meat and potatoes or bake a casserole whose cheesy crust can be browned under the broiler with the lid removed. And, the nonporous enameled pot is handy for marinating meats and storing leftovers in the refrigerator. This particular French oven (some might call it a Dutch oven) is a versatile everyday size with a capacity of 4-1/2 quarts. You'll find this size ideal for four to six servings of chili or chicken with rice. Le Creuset is known for suffusing the exterior of its products with bright, modern colors, while keeping a more neutral tone on the interior to showcase the cuisine. The enamel resists cracking and staining and is best cared for when the contents are stirred with nylon, wood, or silicone utensils. It's also so smooth that food particles tend not to stick, making cleaning by hand or in the dishwasher a snap. Made in France, Le Creuset premium cookware brings joie de vivre to any kitchen it graces. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oK-aq-dAL._AC_SL1324_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B000F5CSSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631545","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000F5CSSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000F5CSSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
