window.products.push({"id":631683,"name":"Soulty Artificial Pink Christmas Tree 6ft - Unlit Premium Hinged Full Classic Spruce Colorful Xmas Tree with 1176 PVC Tips & Foldable Metal Stand -Eas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vwxdDStML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄 New Color Holiday Decoration - Our pink Christmas tree come with a high-end pink finish, which is suitable for many holidays and events. Inspire holiday cheer this season with a unique faux Christmas tree that helps make your family feel complete. If you refuse to settle for a common traditional Christmas, or you're looking for some Halloween decoration, this artificial Christmas tree fulfills all your needs. 🌸Lush Full and Natural Appearance - Christmas tree 6ft with ultra-realistic 1176 PVC branches tips, create the natural appearance of a full-bodied, genuine pine tree and enough space to hang ornaments, making this pink tree look lifelike. Sturdy metal tree base provides stability to keep your tree standing tall & prevent breakage to keep your tree standing all season. Overall, Tree Dimensions: 42\"(Dia) X 73\"(H); Metal Stand Dimensions: 18\"(Dia) X 8.7\"(H). 🎅 Sturdy Foldable Metal Stand & Flame-retardant PVC Needles - This faux Christmas tree crafted with metal hinged body instead of cheap plastic stand. Compared with a cheap plastic stand, our folding metal stand is durable, will provide the tree with greater support and balance, keeping it standing upright and preventing breakage. Our dense and classic flame-retardant PVC branches are Fire-resistant and Non-allergenic, which makes it harmless and durable. 🛠️ Easy Assembly & Fluffing - The Branches of unlit Christmas tree can be bent and set at will, just take minutes to set up and take down. Disassembles into 3 hinged sections to allow for easy assembling, dismantling, and storing. After putting the tree body and the stand together, you are supposed to fluff out the tips to give a full look of your pink tree. (NOTE: Please pay more patience to fluffy all tips straight and make it full, It will be more beautiful.) 🎁 Celebrate Holiday - Soulty Christmas tree will increase the festive atmosphere and spread the festival spirit. You can easily place a selection of lights and ornaments to decorate it with your family, filling the room with Christmas Chee. Accentuate different areas of your living space, office, or even a holiday party, get into the holiday joy with this lush Christmas tree! Assembly and shaping instructions included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vwxdDStML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soulty","source_asin":"B0B5WN89KL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WN89KL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WN89KL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
