window.products.push({"id":631782,"name":"Northlight Green Foyer Christmas Tree Protective Storage Bag - Holds 4 to 6 Foot Trees","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k+4ZAmvdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Now that the holidays are over and it is time to put away your holiday decor. Properly stow away your tree for next year's festivities in this lightweight, sturdy bag with handles. Protects from dust, dirt, and insects all off-season long. Product Features:. Foyer tree storage bag. Holds (1) 4 - 6 foot tree. Never disassemble your tree again, this system compresses and stores your tree all in one piece. Has sturdy and handy side handles to make moving and storing simple. Can be used for trees with potted or decorative bases 17\" diameter when compressed. Material(s): polyester/nylon Note: bag only, tree is not included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k+4ZAmvdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northlight","source_asin":"B081S1FMQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081S1FMQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081S1FMQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
