window.products.push({"id":631840,"name":"Oil Can for Kitchen Grease Container , 1.7L Cooking Oil Storage Container with Strainer Oil Strainer Pot (Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417f9iPJu0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD GRADE MATERIAL: Our UNIKON bacon grease container and the coaster tray are made of fine iron with non-stick coating, which is food grade, environmentally friendly and safe to use. This oil container is high temperature resistance, corrosion resistance, wear resistance and no deformation. The fine mesh strainer is made of stainless steel. PERFECT DESIGN COOKING OIL CONTAINER: The lid stops the dust falling into the oil. The removable mesh strainer is fine enough to filter out old batter pieces from cooked items, and anti-slip coaster tray will prevents oil spillage onto the counter top. Small eagle mouth shaped pour spout design works well to prevent any leakage.Humanized hot isolated handle makes it comfortable to hold. LARGE CAPACITY: This grease storage can holds up to 6.8 cups / 1.7L oil, separate large amounts of frying oil safely and help you reuse cooking oil. MULTIFUNCTION KITCHEN GREASE CONTAINER: Catch and capture, stain and store used cooking oil, coconut oil, pan grill and bacon grease. Oil pot makes oil reusable by filtering particles and offers convenient storage. EASY CLEAN GREASE POT: Please clean the grease pot with soft fiber or other soft material. Do not use hard or sharp cleaning tool in case you might scratch it. Please wash with hot water all over the pot, before your first use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417f9iPJu0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UNIKON","source_asin":"B08H1TS1P1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H1TS1P1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H1TS1P1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
