window.products.push({"id":631842,"name":"ODIKA White Nightstand with Charging Station and 2 USB Ports, Wooden Side Table/End Table with Drawer and Optional Adjustable Shelf for Bedroom, Livin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B+zYexGnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sturdy: The overall structure of the nightstand was made with sturdiness in mind and the dimensions follow conventional nightstand wisdom. The shelf sits on 4 strategically placed pegs to offer maximum balance and security for your items. The bottom of the nightstand sits flush with your floor on all sides. Versatile: This white colored, wood grain textured nightstand goes great in any bedroom setting and would work well in both modern adult and children’s rooms. The finish is wood grain, providing a more elegant look than alternative matte-finished nightstands. Built in Power Outlet: A power outlet with 2 standard plugs and 2 USB plugs comes built into the nightstand allowing for convenient access to plug in your devices. The outlet is built into the top of the nightstand conveniently placed in the back center and the cord is 6 feet long and easily concealed by being wound through a hole in the back of the unit which is hidden by the drawer from the front. Adjustable Shelf: The enclosed bottom comes with an optional shelf that can be adjusted to three different levels that were strategically chosen to suit all of your needs. When not in use, the provided texture stickers make the pre-drilled holes completely unnoticeable. Easy Assembly: A detailed manual is included with both text and images to help make assembly a breeze. We also label all parts and accessories and include the installation tools necessary to make assembly as convenient as possible. Power Rating: 12A, 125V, 60Hz, 1500W USB Output: 5VDC Max 2.1A","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B+zYexGnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ODIKA","source_asin":"B0BG17QZ76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG17QZ76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG17QZ76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
