window.products.push({"id":631909,"name":"Large Cotton Jute Rope Woven Storage Basket with Handles – Natural Laundry Toy Bin Towels Blanket Basket Decor Gift, 14” x 15”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cN2vwsBdL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"CLEAN UP THE MESS AND REORGANIZE YOUR HOME. We are always looking for ways to make the best use of our living space. These woven cotton rope storage baskets are the perfect solution to reduce the mess and make your home more pleasant to live in. Use these baskets to tidy up spaces you’ve been wanting to clean up for a while. DURABLE BASKET WITH ALL NATURAL MATERIALS. These beautifully woven baskets are made with cotton and jute rope – all natural woven materials that will give your home a more comfortable feel. Sized to suit all your organizing needs – 14” in diameter and 15” tall. FUNCTIONALITY FOR ANY SPACE. These spacious multi-use baskets are great for storing blankets, toys, clothes, towels, bedding, personal accessories and everything in-between. The elegant, versatile two-tone design allows the basket to complete any nursery, bedroom, living area and bathroom while adding a warm, cozy touch. WHAT ARE THE CARE INSTRUCTIONS? The basket will arrive folded in its package and there will be temporary creases initially. Simply fill the basket full with towels, clothes or blankets and these creases should disappear naturally over time. Another method is to use a steam iron ON THE WHITE COTTON ROPE ONLY to remove the creases quicker.  For regular maintenance, spot clean only. A MESSAGE FROM US TO YOU. Thank you for considering our product. We are people just like you, who want a simple organizing solution that can also be beautiful at the same time. We want you to love your home and the things you put in it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cN2vwsBdL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PROJECT GREY","source_asin":"B07CFWMRYN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CFWMRYN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CFWMRYN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
