window.products.push({"id":631947,"name":"Cathylin Salt and Pepper Shakers Sets Wooden Salt Pepper Grinder Mill Sets of 2 Paris Manual Mills with Adjustable Ceramic Rotor Refillable (Grey, 8 I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.16,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ajcVEOgwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gorgeous grain & ergonomic shape - With timeless emblematic classic design, the Cathylin 8 inches wood pepper mill will be your everyday companion as you season all your culinary creations. Savvy cooks as you are will rave. about this wood salt and pepper grinder set. Not only a mill set - transcending the ages without ever looking dated and goes perfectly with all your table decorations, Cathylin grinder sets can give. The gloss finish brings an achingly cool, contemporary vibe to the mills that never goes out of fashion. Reliability guarantee - The solid, efficient pepper grinding mechanism can guarantee perfect grinding for many years ahead. Using the silver knob marked with a P/S head, you can also very simply adjust the coarseness of the pepper grind. Specially engineered for grinding – the ceramic mechanism is designed for better seasoning while the button offers a simple and effective way of adjusting the grind setting (the tighter the button is screwed, the finer the pepper grind). More than just cook - the classic style of salt and pepper mills has become iconic and synonymous with a love of good food, creative cooking, and discovery of different cuisine. It will create plenty of theatre at the dining table! So you can wow your guests with the perfect texture and taste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ajcVEOgwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CATHYLIN","source_asin":"B0BTHCQ731","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTHCQ731","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTHCQ731","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":631948,"name":"Country Garden Wax Tarts - Scented Wax Melts, Soy Wax Tarts, Natural Wax Melts, Handmade Soy Wax Tart, Candle Melts, Wax Tart Melts, Soy Wax Melts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sZ5kuWe-L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wick-free and potently infused with aromatic scents, our 100% soy wax tarts make it safe and easy to fill your home with fragrance. Grab a bar, break a block off and toss it in the basin of your plug-in wax warmer. As the scented wax melts, it distributes a noticeably strong throw. We are off to England for the freshest Country Garden experience you could ever imagine! Breathe deeply and welcome the top notes of fresh green clover and ivy that are so popular in country gardens around the world. Middle notes of snapdragon, rose petals, and carnations truly transport you to the English Countryside where fragrances are fresh and the world is simple again. The bass notes bring in the woodsy smell of white musk and fig leaves reminding you of the rich soil and deep undergrowth that makes this garden perfect. If you look in the distance you can almost see a warm and welcoming cottage awaiting you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sZ5kuWe-L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07L5RR738","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631948","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L5RR738","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L5RR738","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
