window.products.push({"id":631965,"name":"ART PARK Guan Yin Statue, Quan Yin Statue, Kwan Yin Statue, Kuan Yin Statue, Home Decor, Best Chinese Feng Shui Gifts. (11 Inches Top Ceramic Guan Yin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g1qkhIFfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Our Guan Yin statue is a classic ceramic work from China's porcelain capital. This GuanYin statue is made from a rare Oriental soil. This Oriental soil has very low impurity content, and the ceramic products such as GuanYin statue made from this soil are very beautiful. These Oriental clay ceramics,  white as milk and very transparent. Color such as sheep fat, white jade, scallion white. It has enjoyed the reputation of \"Ivory white\", \"Goose down white\", \"Chinese white\" and \"Ceramic pearl\".It has a history of nearly 500 years to use this unique soil  to create ceramic Goddess of mercy statues This Guan Yin statue is a blend of \"Ivory white\" and \"Carmine red. This GuanYin statue shows a very unique double aesthetic. This Guan Yin statue has a very well-proportioned body. This Guanyin's modeling is dignified and serene. This GuanYin statue is glazed and exquisite. This Guan Yin statue vividly shows the folds of GuanYin's clothes, Changes in the level and depth of skin texture. Guanyin's face in particular, very plump and delicate, With pearls and pearls of sparkle. In the sunlight the flesh was faintly red Full display of guanyin's kindness, Like a gentle mother. She is full of compassion,tolerance, kindness, harmony and elegance. This Guan Yin statue shows the inner spirit of guanyin very well. It has been warmly welcomed and sought after  by people in southeast Asia, Japan, South Korea. If you are a fan of GuanYin,  Please take her home She will bring Peace, Serenity, Safety and Protection to you and your family If you have any dissatisfaction after receiving the goods, you can return the goods at any time  if the products are in good condition Includes a free Gift","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g1qkhIFfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ART PARK","source_asin":"B07S6K14M9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-631965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S6K14M9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S6K14M9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
